{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788119556902,"sessionID":"ses_fabcc0d67ffe81ceFkgf1oLPKJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8c5bc0408d046273","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/check/mod.rs","newString":"pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 16] = [\n    \"chars\",\n    \"collect\",\n    \"length\",\n    \"fields\",\n    \"flatten\",\n    \"i64\",\n    \"jsonlines\",\n    \"map\",\n    \"max\",\n    \"range\",\n    \"reverse\",\n    \"select\",\n    \"sort\",\n    \"str\",\n    \"sum\",\n    \"tail\",\n];","oldString":"pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 14] = [\n    \"chars\",\n    \"collect\",\n    \"length\",\n    \"fields\",\n    \"flatten\",\n    \"i64\",\n    \"jsonlines\",\n    \"map\",\n    \"range\",\n    \"reverse\",\n    \"select\",\n    \"sort\",\n    \"str\",\n    \"tail\",\n];"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/check/mod.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/check/mod.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/check/mod.rs\n@@ -391,22 +391,24 @@\n /// `tail`, `collect`, `fields`, `sort`, and `reverse` are polymorphic and checked from\n /// `synth`'s own arms; `select` and `map` rebind `.`. All fourteen are reserved the same way,\n /// and the docs harness (tests/docs.rs) reads this list to insist each one has a reference\n /// page.\n-pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 14] = [\n+pub const BUILTIN_NAMES: [&str; 16] = [\n     \"chars\",\n     \"collect\",\n     \"length\",\n     \"fields\",\n     \"flatten\",\n     \"i64\",\n     \"jsonlines\",\n     \"map\",\n+    \"max\",\n     \"range\",\n     \"reverse\",\n     \"select\",\n     \"sort\",\n     \"str\",\n+    \"sum\",\n     \"tail\",\n ];\n \n /// Functions the language provides. Unary like every other f