{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788119788480,"sessionID":"ses_fabcc0d67ffe81ceFkgf1oLPKJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8d41920c548840ed","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs","newString":"                    // Purely textually gated below, like tlAt and tlRange: nothing here needs\n                    // the element type, so there is nothing to record on the walk.\n                    Builtin::IntToI64\n                    | Builtin::Range\n                    | Builtin::Collect\n                    | Builtin::Length\n                    | Builtin::Flatten\n                    | Builtin::Tail\n                    | Builtin::Fields\n                    | Builtin::Chars\n                    | Builtin::Sort\n                    | Builtin::Reverse\n                    | Builtin::Sum\n                    | Builtin::Max => {}","oldString":"                    // Purely textually gated below, like tlAt and tlRange: nothing here needs\n                    // the element type, so there is nothing to record on the walk.\n                    Builtin::IntToI64\n                    | Builtin::Range\n                    | Builtin::Collect\n                    | Builtin::Length\n                    | Builtin::Flatten\n                    | Builtin::Tail\n                    | Builtin::Fields\n                    | Builtin::Chars\n                    | Builtin::Sort\n                    | Builtin::Reverse => {}"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n@@ -679,9 +679,11 @@\n             | Builtin::Tail\n             | Builtin::Fields\n             | Builtin::Chars\n             | Builtin::Sort\n-            | Builtin::Reverse => {}\n+            | Builtin::Reverse\n+            | Builtin::Sum\n+            | Builtin::Max => {}\n         }\n         self.walk(arg);\n     }\n }\n","filediff":{"file":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs","patch":"Index: /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n===================================================================\n--- /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n+++ /home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-140/src/emit_go.rs\n@@ -679,9 +679,11 @@\n             | Builtin::Tail\n             | Builtin::Fields\n             | Builtin::Chars\n             | Builtin::Sort\n-            | Builtin::Reverse => {}\n+            | Builtin::Reverse\n+            | Builtin::Sum\n+            | Builtin::Max => {}\n         }\n         self.walk(arg);\n     }\n }\n","additions":3,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"src/emit_go.rs","time":{"start":1788119788469,"end":1788119788475}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Now the Go Builtin walk match — it has an exhaustive `match which` in the `Collect` walk. Let me update it to include Sum and Max (as textually-gated, so no-op arms).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0543e9620001gZ10f5iiSIS6bU","sessionID":"ses_fabcc0d67ffe81ceFkgf1oLPKJ","messageID":"msg_0543e79ee001AMm0kKROtp67Zp"}}
