s files. For max returning Opt, the node_types will include `builtin.max` etc.\n\nLet me create the files:\n\n1. sum_ints.yaml\n2. sum_negative.yaml  \n3. sum_int64s.yaml\n4. sum_empty.yaml\n5. sum_wrap.yaml\n6. max_ints.yaml\n7. max_negative.yaml\n8. max_int64s.yaml\n9. max_empty.yaml\n10. max_empty_unwrap_refuses.yaml\n\nLet me write them. I'll include node_types lines where I'm confident, and tag_corpus will fix any errors.\n\nActually, to be safe, I'll write the files with a `node_types:` line and then rely on tag_corpus to correct. Let me create them now.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05446e5c0001XJ1frKN3Hxe6kW","sessionID":"ses_fabcc0d67ffe81ceFkgf1oLPKJ","messageID":"msg_054469d17001utD2cQiKnP6x9d"}}
